{"id":"bondad","lemma":"bondad","pos":"noun","rank":2992,"glosses":["goodness","good deed","affability"],"ipa":"/bonˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"bondades"},"order":2997,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-bondad.wav","examples":[{"text":"La justicia y la bondad son virtudes.","en":"Justice and kindness are virtues.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"justice"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"virtue","l":"virtud"}]},{"text":"Quiero expresar mi más profundo agradecimiento por su bondad.","en":"I wish to express my deep appreciation for your kindness.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to express"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"deep"},{"g":"gratitude"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Su bondad hizo que se me pusiera un nudo en la garganta.","en":"Her kindness gave me a lump in my throat.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[8,12,"lump in one's throat"]]}]}